{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach and take visible object, inspect or move it, in order to finally process and return it to base. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToLocation    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ReturnToBase    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectSmall    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />",
